WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,300
Losing Thousand Person Armor, Progress 256/1000, Great

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,100
Am I really a war freak?

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,400
I'm not alive anymore

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,800
Come chase me if you can

5
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,760
I did this when I knew I was hopeless.

6
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,860
But if you do it, you do it

7
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:21,760
Beginning of the end

8
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,860
Human nature is to stick together

9
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,360
Not bad enough to kill each other

10
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:36,270
Originally the scholarship was like nothing

11
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:37,470
It's the end of the world

12
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:42,390
There is also the idea of adding a grade-level scholarship, but the task still needs to be done.

13
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:43,990
Let's see how well we cover him

14
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,090
Mission accomplished

15
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:46,090
Break out of the Stone Hall

16
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:48,990
The choice to get unlimited disgust comes out once

17
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:50,390
Save the reward this time
